<div class="container">
  <h1>${$global.title}</h1>
  <div class="content">
    <h1 id="theming-guide" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#theming-guide">#</a> Theming Guide</h1>
<p>Customize your site’s appearance with the MarkoPress theme system.</p>
<h2 id="overview" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#overview">#</a> Overview</h2>
<p>MarkoPress uses a powerful <strong>slot-based theme system</strong> that lets you customize any part of your site without forking the entire theme. The theme is built with:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>CSS Custom Properties</strong> - Easy color and style customization</li>
<li><strong>Component Slots</strong> - Override any component without touching the core</li>
<li><strong>Layout System</strong> - Flexible layouts for different page types</li>
<li><strong>Dark Mode</strong> - Built-in dark mode support</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="quick-customization" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#quick-customization">#</a> Quick Customization</h2>
<p>The fastest way to customize your site is through CSS variables.</p>
